# =============================================================================================
# What must never reach the remote, and why.
#
# The first two sections are the ones that matter. Everything below them is noise control.
# =============================================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets. OPS-DEP-019: secrets are injected at runtime and are not present in environment files
# committed to source. `.env.example` IS committed — it is the template and holds no value.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
*.env
!*.env.example
deploy/.env
**/.env.local
*.pem
*.key
!**/src/**/*.key
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
credentials.json
secrets.yaml

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Assistant working files.
#
# CLAUDE.md is the project instruction file, IMPLEMENTATION_PROMPTS.md is the prompt sequence
# written against it, and .claude/ holds session state and settings. They are how this repository
# was built, not part of what it is; a reader of the product should not have to route around them.
# Remove a line here if you decide the instructions belong in the open — CLAUDE.md in particular
# is the only place several conventions are written down.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CLAUDE.md
IMPLEMENTATION_PROMPTS.md
.claude/
.claude*/
**/.claude/
CLAUDE.local.md
.cursor/
.aider*
.mcp.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output. Reproducible from source, and large: src/app/build alone is 85 MB and
# src/webui/node_modules is 293 MB.
#
# The compiled interface bundle under src/app/src/main/resources/aspm/app/webui/assets IS
# committed on purpose — the application serves it, and the deployment has no Node step.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
build/
out/
bin/
!deploy/app/bin/
.gradle/
gradle-app.setting
node_modules/
.vite/
*.class
*.jar
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
*.war

# The runnable image content is copied here at deploy time from src/app/build/install.
deploy/app/install/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local runtime state — a container's data directory, logs, and anything a probe wrote.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
deploy/postgres/data/
deploy/**/data/
*.log
logs/
*.pid
scratch/
tmp/
.tmp/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor and operating system.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
